{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI下一代旗艦模型GPT 6.2 Astra疑似已進入小範圍灰度測試。近日，多名海外開發者在Codex使用量統計中發現名為「gpt-6.2-astra」的新模型標識，部分賬户的調用佔比達到19.8%。與此同時，OpenAI官方公佈了一款尚未發佈的內部模型在三維工程設計基準測試中的成績，較現款GPT 6 Astra提升約47.3%，引發外界對新一代模型即將發佈的猜測。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584964.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:46.823340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:53:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_hash":"d139c966e92d49de1ffed0083fb1ad58e18db0cb55f6e7538067bd820dec83c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}